        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8454, Arts and Crafts Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Arts and Crafts Single Cylinder Deadbolt is available in 4 finishes including oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, matte black, and brass, all of which look beautiful on this traditional door lock. The Arts & Crafts Style of door hardware has long been a favorite for it's unique take on southwest decor. The Single Cylinder Arts and Crafts Deadbolt will fit doors 1-3/4  inches to 3 inches thick with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. As a single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/double-cylinder-arts-and-crafts-deadbolt-emtek-8354\"><b>Double Cylinder Arts and Crafts Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional Arts and Crafts Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Arts & Crafts Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8454-finish.jpg?v=1704354519\" width=\"456\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 8454 Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
