                "title": "Single Cylinder Arts and Crafts Deadbolt",
                "description": "The Arts and Crafts Single Cylinder Deadbolt is available in 4 finishes including oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, matte black, and brass, all of which look beautiful on this traditional door lock. The Arts & Crafts Style of door hardware has long been a favorite for it's unique take on southwest decor. The Single Cylinder Arts and Crafts Deadbolt will fit doors 1-3/4  inches to 3 inches thick with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. As a single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior.\r\n",
